         SHORT="Mozilla Network Security Services cryptographic and TLS libraries"

cat << EOF
The Network Security Services (NSS) package is a set of libraries designed to
support cross-platform development of security-enabled client and server
applications. Applications built with NSS can support TLS, PKCS #5, PKCS #7,
PKCS #11, PKCS #12, S/MIME, X.509 certificates, and other security
standards. NSS is used by browsers, mail clients, and server software.
EOF
